# One-tree plan, phase 3: the fixture inside a Cambium tree (tree.html).
#
# Pictograph's canvas draws through a texture producer in a custom-leaf slot.
# Frames are timed from load, in the first window, and again once it has
# had 600 frames to settle, in the same windows p3_presenter_fixture times on
# index.html. A click on the fixture's web node, through the tree's own
# pointer path, picks it.
log phase 3: the fixture inside a Cambium tree
timing start fixture-startup
settle 240
timing stop
wait 600
capture p3_tree_fixture_startup
settle 600
timing start fixture-steady
settle 240
timing stop
wait 600
click-node https://example.test/i2p-port
settle 2
assert snap picked == https://example.test/i2p-port
capture p3_tree_fixture_picked
